	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salutem in domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Literas tuas, vir venerande, 23. die aprilis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>accepi, quibus sum certificatus consultum fore, ut pro temporis ratione negotium <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>de ministro verbi ecclesię <placeName ref="l44">Bethswandensi</placeName> promovendo pauli<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>sper differamus, donec comitia <placeName ref="l21">Badena</placeName> nunc nostri gratia indicta fini<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>antur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Speras haud dubie his peractis res nostras paulo mitiores <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>futuras omniaque pacari; diversum ego sentio, timeo nobis pacis <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>conditiones prioribus multo peiores recipiend, quod dominus longe avertat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Quare operę precium puto, ut negocium Christi diutius non prolongetur, quin <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ecclesię praeficiatur quamprimum concionator.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ad annos iam duos non proprium <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>habuit pastorem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Hostes nostri in rebus suis nobis longe <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>sunt vigilantiores, qui neque comiciorum neque conciliorum habita <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ratione papatum pergunt fideliter promovere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Idem et nos in <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>causa Christi domini nostri faciundum esse pietas suadebit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Rogatum igitur te <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>denuo volui, ut, si fieri potuerit, virum nobis, qui<note type="misc">gestrichen.</note> doctrina et <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>vitę conversatione sancta clarum mittas, cuius quoque familia honesta <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>sit, ne quae bene deceat, prophana vita destruat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Habiturus est <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ex aerario ecclesiastico 80 aureos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in domino bene, qui <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>etiam vitam tuam in reipublicae christianę<note type="misc">fehlt d. Acc.! (salutem?)</note> prolongare dignetur.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Datę calendis 12. iunii 1563 <placeName ref="l176">Claronę</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/><persName ref="p8303">Fridolinus Fonteius</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>apud <placeName ref="l646">Claronenses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>verbi minister, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>tui observandissimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo venerandoque viro <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Henricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesię <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> verbi <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ministro fidelissimo dominoque <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>meo et fratri colendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
